    "No query-specific hepatic clearance or metabolic-stability measurement is available; L6 records are for close analogs (thalidomide, amino-isoindolinone) and other anilines, not the query.",
    "Potential NAT-mediated acetylation of the query's primary aromatic amine is not directly measured; the supplied NAT records concern aminodantrolene and ANZP.",
