  ],
  "decision_summary": "Predicted high (F >= 20%). The favorable physicochemical prior for this low-MW, neutral, low-logP amino-isoindolinone/glutarimide is supported by uniformly high human F values in the L1 gold contexts and by L6 mechanistic records showing low hepatic clearance for close structural analogs (thalidomide, amino-isoindolinone). No affirmative threshold-relevant low-F evidence is present. Confidence remains moderate because no direct query-specific absolute F or clearance measurement is available."
}

